    "body": "## Steps to reproduce\n1. Open a private browsing tab \n1. Go to another app (or notification) \n1. Open a link from that app (not a custom tab) \n\n### Expected behavior\nThe tab is opened as a normal Fenix tab.\n\n### Actual behavior\nThe tab is opened as a private browsing tab. \n\n### Device information\n* Android device: Android 8, LG G6\n* Fenix version: 1.0.1921\n\n┆Issue is synchronized with this [Jira Task](https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/browse/FNXV2-11734)\n",
